{
 "scope": "The CODIMENSION-m EILENBERG SLICING INEQUALITY in measurable-majorant form, and its null-slicing corollary in both the raw and the normalized convention. THIS IS NOT SLICE MEASURABILITY and NOT the general codimension-m coarea formula. No hole migrated. The log-concave Cheeger-Buser line belongs to collaborator Wang Haocheng and was not touched.",
 "head": "34b92695ece4f636a1a7f1eafbbf41c685ee0348",
 "origin_main": "34b92695ece4f636a1a7f1eafbbf41c685ee0348",
